# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Data & regenerable caches — NOT versioned.
# All of cache/ is rebuilt by the R/Python pipeline (extraction caches, matched
# datasets, per-fold climatologies, anomaly rasters, USDM downloads). The code
# plus the small tables/ and figs/ outputs are sufficient to reproduce it.
# Large inference grids live on /data/ssd3 and are never in the repo.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
cache/

# Large local data artifacts (belt-and-suspenders — these should live on /data,
# not in git). tif/png are intentionally NOT globbed so figs/ deliverables stay.
*.rds
*.nc
*.parquet

# R / OS cruft
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.DS_Store
